Package: linux-modules-arm
Version: {{ VER }}
Architecture: {{ ARCH }}
Maintainer: Gabriel Guillou <guillou.gabriel@gmail.com>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: linux-image-{{ KVER }} (= {{ VER }})
Description: ARM-generic kernel modules
 This package contains the kernel modules common to all ARM devices
 (ARM64 core, kernel command line, PL011 UART, MMC/USB/RTC subsystem
 cores). It is built on top of linux-image-common and must be installed
 alongside it. The ARM device-specific modules packages
 (linux-modules-rpi3/rpi4/rpi5/rk3588) depend on this package.
